{
  "name": "@agentic-toolkit/adh-site-homes",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Every fleet site's workspace implementation, one SiteHomeModel per entry. Each site re-exports its own; the hub mounts the same objects as routes under /<workspace>/<siteId>. One entry per site so a consumer pulls only what it mounts.",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "files": [
    "dist"
  ],
  "sideEffects": [
    "**/*.css"
  ],
  "comment:exports": "One entry PER SITE, and deliberately no barrel of models: a barrel would import all 48 and defeat the per-route code splitting this package exists to keep. The `.` entry is data only (FLEET_HOME_SITE_IDS) and imports no model. `development` -> src so `next dev` gets HMR; prod resolves dist.",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "development": "./src/index.ts",
      "import": "./dist/index.js"
    },
    "./academy": {
